{"id":99877116,"slug":"cerebral-etc-the-guardian-does-a","title":"Cerebral, Etc.: The Guardian Does a Feature Quoting Owen Muir, M.D.","subtitle":"The fall out of Cerebral’s ADHD for Most strategy has been stimulant shortages for all… why that was never going to work","post_date":"2023-01-30T20:43:02.756Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/cerebral-etc-the-guardian-does-a","wordcount":196,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T22:00:35.838Z","body_sha256":"d50e72b07dc179986c598515f57e9fc6373910f560ebd354cf25ffd73a238665","text_words":197,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>We only make a limited amount of stimulant medication by law. The DEA. It enforces.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!JzmC!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa36bf51a-080c-4ba9-8bff-5b1ac6b11f6f_3072x2048.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!JzmC!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa36bf51a-080c-4ba9-8bff-5b1ac6b11f6f_3072x2048.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!JzmC!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa36bf51a-080c-4ba9-8bff-5b1ac6b11f6f_3072x2048.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!JzmC!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa36bf51a-080c-4ba9-8bff-5b1ac6b11f6f_3072x2048.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!JzmC!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-med